@MovieStreaming_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Get Movies (Default Paged)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Search Movies by Keyword
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?search=sam
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Filter Movies by Genre (ID or Slug)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?genre=hanh-dong
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Filter Movies by Release Year
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?year=2026
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Filter Movies by Type (single / series)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?type=series
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Sort Movies (newest / oldest / rating / title)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?sortBy=rating&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Combined Filtering
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies?search=sam&year=2026&type=series&sortBy=newest&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Get Movie Details By ID
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies/2
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Get Movie Details By Slug
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies/slug/anh-sam-cua-em
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Get All Genres
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/genres
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 4 — Get Genre By ID
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/genres/1
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 5 — Get Movie Episodes (Lightweight Ordered List)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies/2/episodes
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 5 — Get Specific Episode of a Movie
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/movies/2/episodes/2
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 5 — Get Episode Details By Episode ID
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/episodes/2
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 5 — Get Episode Playback Sources (HLS .m3u8 & multiple servers)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/episodes/2/sources
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 2 — Search KKPhim External Movies
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/import/kkphim/search?keyword=sam
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 2 — Test External Movie Detail (Preview without DB save)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/import/kkphim/test/anh-sam-cua-em
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 2 — Import Movie from KKPhim into SQL Server
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/import/kkphim/movie/anh-sam-cua-em
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 3 — Register New User
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demouser",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### PHASE 3 — Login (Get Access & Refresh Tokens)
# @name login
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "demouser",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### PHASE 3 — Get Current User Profile (Requires Bearer token)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 3 — Test Authenticated Endpoint
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/test
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 3 — Test Admin Authorization
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/admin-test
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 3 — Refresh Token (Rotation)
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### PHASE 3 — Change Password
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/users/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "DemoPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewDemoPassword456!"
}

### PHASE 3 — Logout (Revoke Refresh Token)
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### =========================================================================
### PHASE 6 — WATCH HISTORY & FAVORITES
### =========================================================================

### PHASE 6 — Save Watch Progress (Episode 8, Progress 523s / 1440s)
POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/watch-history
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "episodeId": 8,
  "progressSeconds": 523,
  "durationSeconds": 1440
}

### PHASE 6 — Get Watch History (Paged)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/watch-history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Get Continue Watching (Incomplete episodes only)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/watch-history/continue?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Delete an Episode from Watch History
DELETE {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/watch-history/8
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Clear All Watch History
DELETE {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/watch-history
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

