POST {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/favorites/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Check Favorite Status (Movie 2)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/favorites/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Get User Favorites (Paged)
GET {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/favorites?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### PHASE 6 — Remove Movie from Favorites (Movie 2)
DELETE {{MovieStreaming_HostAddress}}/api/favorites/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

